// What the model gives, written by `BLESS=1`.
run: the written order
outcome 1
  accepted
  value ?k: !
  value A: Option<!>
  value None: Option<!>
  check `None <= A`: Ok(Identity)
  I* of a final state: []
start run
  record #0 None: Option<?k>
  record #1 None <= A
  decomposition #0 None: Option<?k>: no parts
step 1 run: solve A
  join A: Option {Variant(None), Variant(Some)}
  decomposition #1 None <= A: parts
    record #2 ?k <=p A.Payload(Some)
fallback 2 run
  default ?k: !
    record #3 ?k: !
  default `A.Payload(Some)`: !
    record #4 A.Payload(Some): !
  decomposition #2 ?k <=p A.Payload(Some): parts
  decomposition #3 ?k: !: no parts
  decomposition #4 A.Payload(Some): !: no parts
